         <title>Masters of PixInsight V8 Scripts v1.5.5</title>
         <description>
            <p>v1.5.5 — Fixed SHO-AIP's feature-id: it was nested under the
            original author's menu path (Multichannel Synthesis > SHO-AIP :
            MoP V8 > SHO-AIP) instead of replacing it entirely, which could
            collide with a separate install of the unmodified original. Now
            files under MoP V8 &gt; SHO-AIP only. 28 scripts total.</p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
